    rdfs:label "IdentifierLegConcreteAnchorExample" .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_02_twelve_leg_deep_dive_sections_02_identifier_leg_concrete_anchor silm:hasExample "In 'IdentifierLegConcreteAnchor', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, MicrochipID_44: the ISO 11784 RFID microchip identifier 44B2F9 implanted in Mittens; scanned at Tartu Animal Clinic on the 2026 annual exam; stored as field microchip_id in VetRecord_77; also, IdentifierArrow_Microchip: the typed arrow MicrochipID_44 -> MittensColimitApex; distinct from record_leg (VetRecord_77 -> MittensColimitApex); also, ScanEvent_Tartu_2026: the physical clinic scanner read event at Tartu Animal Clinic in May 2026 that produced the chip read result 44B2F9; source provenance for MicrochipID_44." .
